<title>UK: Rabobank sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rabobank Deutschland AG said it has issued 12 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on Deutsche Telekom.</p>
<p>Rabobank has also issued two million &quot;chooser&quot; warrants on Deutsche Telekom which give the holder the right to choose on 14.Jan.97 whether he has a call or put warrant. Thereafter the call or put warrants are exercisable American style any time from 15.Jan.97 to 20.Mar.98.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	20.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	19.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT, DUSS		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>+ + + + + + + + +</p>
<p> WARRANT    STRIKE	ISSUE	 PREMIUM   SPOT REF 32 DEM</p>
<p> CALL 1     30 DEM	4.48 DEM    7.75 PCT</p>
<p> CALL 2     35 DEM	2.12 DEM    16.00 PCT</p>
<p> CALL 3     40 DEM	0.84 DEM    27.63 PCT</p>
<p> PUT 4	25 DEM	0.46 DEM    23.31 PCT</p>
<p> PUT 5	30 DEM	1.71 DEM    11.59 PCT</p>
<p> PUT 6	35 DEM	4.45 DEM    4.53 PCT</p>
<p> CHOOSER    32 DEM	4.90 DEM    15.31 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
